From 6720089538b44af360dd6b0470366a05040f76f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph <joseph@giallovision.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:19:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LCM baseline with exact img2img steps; presets apply when
 picked and are retuned; sweep grow/blur and fast vits depth

Steps 4 / CFG 1.8 / noise 0.02 baselines (versioned one-time migration),
img2img_fix_steps option, payload checks for LCM CFG, img2img step count and
Video Input cadence. ui_exec Parameter Execute DAT applies the Example Preset
on pick, adds Re-apply Preset and Edit prompt_seq. Video Input presets use a
fixed seed and cadence 1; depth sweep presets use vits, grow and blur.
OpenCV tests skip when cv2 is missing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BhiEzmwUbwDK67k3BY9b4Y
